s</DescriptorName></MeshHeading><MeshHeading><DescriptorName UI="D054875" MajorTopicYN="Y">Ubiquitination</DescriptorName></MeshHeading><MeshHeading><DescriptorName UI="D011944" MajorTopicYN="Y">Receptors, Androgen</DescriptorName><QualifierName UI="Q000378" MajorTopicYN="N">metabolism</QualifierName><QualifierName UI="Q000235" MajorTopicYN="N">genetics</QualifierName></MeshHeading><MeshHeading><DescriptorName UI="D008297" MajorTopicYN="N">Male</DescriptorName></MeshHeading><MeshHeading><DescriptorName UI="D051379" MajorTopicYN="N">Mice</DescriptorName></MeshHeading><MeshHeading><DescriptorName UI="D006801" MajorTopicYN="N">Humans</DescriptorName></MeshHeading><MeshHeading><DescriptorName UI="D044842" MajorTopicYN="N">Cullin Proteins</DescriptorName><QualifierName UI="Q000378" MajorTopicYN="N">metabolism</QualifierName><QualifierName UI="Q000235" MajorTopicYN="N">genetics</QualifierName></MeshHeading><MeshHeading><DescriptorName UI="D044767" MajorTopicYN="N">Ubiquitin-Protein Ligases</DescriptorName><QualifierName UI="Q000378" MajorTopicYN="N">metabolism</QualifierName><QualifierName UI="Q000235" MajorTopicYN="N">genetics</QualifierName></MeshHeading><MeshHeading><DescriptorName UI="D014564" MajorTopicYN="Y">Urogenital Abnormalities</DescriptorName><QualifierName UI="Q000378" MajorTopicYN="N">metabolism</QualifierName><QualifierName UI="Q000235" MajorTopicYN="N">genetics</QualifierName></MeshHeading><MeshHeading><DescriptorName UI="D018345" MajorTopicYN="N">Mice, Knockout</DescriptorName></MeshHeading><MeshHeading><DescriptorName UI="D057809" MajorTopicYN="N">HEK293 Cells</DescriptorName></MeshHeading><MeshHeading><DescriptorName UI="D024642" MajorTopicYN="Y">Potassium Channels, Voltage-Gated</DescriptorName><QualifierName UI="Q000378" MajorTopicYN="N">metabolism</QualifierName><QualifierName UI="Q000235" MajorTopicYN="N">genetics</QualifierName></MeshHeading><MeshHeading><DescriptorName UI="D013737" MajorTopicYN="N">Testis</DescriptorName><QualifierName UI="Q000378" MajorTopicYN="N">metabolism</QualifierName></MeshHeading></MeshHeadingList><KeywordList Owner="NOTNLM"><Keyword MajorTopicYN="N">KCTD13</Keyword><Keyword MajorTopicYN="N">STUB1</Keyword><Keyword MajorTopicYN="N">androgen receptor</Keyword><Keyword MajorTopicYN="N">genitourinary tract</Keyword><Keyword MajorTopicYN="N">ubiquitination</Keyword></KeywordList><CoiStatement><b>Conflict of interest</b> &#x2014;The authors declare that they have no conflicts of interest with the contents of this article.</CoiStatement></MedlineCitation><PubmedData><History><PubMedPubDate PubStatus="revised"><Year>2025</Year><Month>1</Month><Day>9</Day></PubMedPubDate><PubMedPubDate PubStatus="received"><Year>2024</Year><Month>9</Month><Day>3</Day></PubMedPubDate><PubMedPubDate PubStatus="accepted"><Year>2025</Year><Month>2</Month><Day>10</Day></PubMedPubDate><PubMedPubDate PubStatus="medline"><Year>2025</Year><Month>2</Month><Day>19</Day><Hour>12</Hour><Minute>25</Minute></PubMedPubDate><PubMedPubDate PubStatus="pubmed"><Year>2025</Year><Month>2</Month><Day>19</Day><Hour>12</Hour><Minute>24</Minute></PubMedPubDate><PubMedPubDate PubStatus="entrez"><Year>2025</Year><Month>2</Month><Day>19</Day><Hour>6</Hour><Minute>23</Minute></PubMedPubDate><PubMedPubDate PubStatus="pmc-release"><Year>2026</Year><Month>2</Month><Day>28</Day></PubMedPubDate></History><PublicationStatus>ppublish</PublicationStatus><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">39968753</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="mid">NIHMS2058493</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC12080724</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1096/fj.202402072RR</ArticleId></ArticleIdList><ReferenceList><Reference><Citation>Mangelsdorf DJ, Thummel C, Beato M, Herrlich P, Schutz G, Umesono K, Blumberg B, Kastner P, Mark M, Chambon P, and Evans RM (1995) The nuclear receptor superfamily: the second decade. Cell 83, 835&#x2013;839</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC6159888</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">8521507</ArticleId></ArticleId